 "traps": [
  "Spring Boot comes from the parent spring-boot-starter-parent of the root pom; Lombok and spring-boot-starter-test (JUnit Jupiter, Mockito) are declared once in the root pom and inherited by every module, so they belong to the root unit",
  "every Spring framework is a starter: Spring MVC from spring-boot-starter-web, Spring Security, Spring Data Redis, MongoDB and Elasticsearch, Spring AMQP from spring-boot-starter-amqp",
  "the frameworks differ per module: MyBatis only in mall-mbg, Thymeleaf only in mall-demo, MongoDB and AMQP only in mall-portal, Elasticsearch only in mall-search",
  "mall-admin declares no framework of its own beyond the Spring Boot plugin: it gets MyBatis and Spring Security through mall-mbg and mall-security",
  "PageHelper, Druid, MyBatis Generator, springdoc and Hutool are plugins or utilities, not counted as frameworks here",
  "all services are in document/docker/docker-compose-env.yml, a folder that looks like documentation; Aliyun OSS and Alipay are named only by their SDKs",
  "only frameworks and services are measured; the other facets are in unknown"
 ],
 "cases": [
  "framework-through-plugin",
